      "id": "attribution",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Original HOG inspection controls - MIT",
      "description": "Original MIT synthetic images, native SVM training and projects by OpenCVDataflowGUI contributors. Sixteen noisy training windows exclude the query noise seeds. Two query parts have exact construction boxes; a ring is a distractor. Raw margins are not probabilities. The permissive threshold retains extra detections, while multiscale search yields overlapping windows removed by explicit IoU suppression. Native people models are exercised only on a blank control: this is not pedestrian accuracy evidence. See README.md, SOURCES.md, truth.json and benchmark.json. All image data and saved custom models are original; no customer captures.",
